  "cards": {
    "samurai_props": "Full-body figure in dark lacquered Japanese-style armour: gold crescent helmet crest, dark face mask, gold circular crest on the chest plate, brown and cream patterned skirt. Holds a straw broom in the left hand and a blue cleaning-spray bottle in the right; a grey bucket with a feather duster stands at the feet. Detailed digital illustration on a cream background.",
    "samurai_dress": "Armoured samurai warrior in full lacquered armour, standing front-facing with arms slightly out, with a katana and a second blade at the sides. Dark navy-black armour plates with tan and cream trim; cream roundel crest on the chest; ornate horned helmet with a face mask; tan sash; skirt panels with a red and cream floral pattern; dark greaves. Flat illustration with ink-like shading.",
    "handyman_front": "Full-body figure in dark lacquered Japanese samurai armour with a gold-crested helmet and face mask, standing front-on with feet together. Wears a short-sleeved royal-blue polo shirt with a small round white emblem on the chest. Carries a grey mop and bucket. Photoreal, plain light background.",
    "handyman_side": "Armored samurai figure, full body, standing in side profile facing left, on a plain cream background. Black lacquered armour with brown-gold trim; helmet with a gold crest and a dark face mask; red-and-cream floral patterned skirt; blue polo shirt. A long dark pole with a feather duster at the end.",
    "handyman_back": "Armoured figure in black lacquered samurai-style armour and dark helmet with gold crescent horns, seen from behind, full length, on a cream background. Beige hakama with a red floral pattern; dark tabi-style footwear. Carries a mop over the shoulder.",
    "handyman_tq": "Armoured figure in a dark lacquered samurai-style helmet with gold crescent crest and full dark plate armour, wearing a bright blue polo shirt with a small white emblem; patterned beige hakama-style skirt with red floral motif; holds a blue spray bottle.",
    "stick": "A simple black stick figure drawn on white: round head, straight body, arms out, legs apart. No details.",
    "marky": "A large orange-and-white guinea pig standing in a narrow brick city alley, filling the gap between buildings. Chunky rounded body, short legs with pale feet, small dark eye and pink nose; orange patches on head and back, white face.",
    "layout": "A rough line drawing: two tall rectangles for buildings with a big round shape squeezed between them, labelled marky, building, building.",
    "bathroom_frame": "Photoreal frame: a bright tiled bathroom; the armoured samurai in a blue polo kneels at the toilet scrubbing the bowl with a brush; a mop and bucket by the wall.",
    "hall_frame": "Photoreal frame: a lived-in family hallway with coats on hooks and school bags; the armoured samurai in a blue polo walks in through the front door carrying a toolbox."
